"}]}}, {"en": "In conclusion, action is required now.", "vi": "Kết luận, cần hành động ngay.", "pa": {"cau": "In conclusion, action is required now.", "ipa_day_du": "/ɪn/ /kəˈnkluːʒən/ /ˈækʃən/ /ɪz/ /riːˈkwaɪəd/ /naʊ/", "ipa_noi": "/ɪn kəˈnkluːʒən ˈækʃən‿ɪz riːˈkwaɪəd naʊ/", "tho_noi": "in-kơnkluzhơn-akshơn-iz-rikwaiơd-nao", "tu": [{"tu": "In", "ipa": "ɪn", "nguon": "cmu"}, {"tu": "conclusion", "ipa": "kəˈnkluːʒən", "nguon": "cmu"}, {"tu": "action", "ipa": "ˈækʃən", "nguon": "cmu"}, {"tu": "is", "ipa": "ɪz", "nguon": "cmu"}, {"tu": "required", "ipa": "riːˈkwaɪəd", "nguon": "cmu"}, {"tu": "now", "ipa": "naʊ", "nguon": "cmu"}]}}, {"en": "Overall, the picture is mixed.", "vi": "Nhìn chung, bức tranh còn lẫn lộn.", "pa": {"cau": "Overall, the picture is mixed.", "ipa_day_du": "/ˈəʊvəˌrɔːl/ /ðə/ /ˈpɪktʃə/ /ɪz/ /mɪkst/", "ipa_noi": "/ˈəʊvəˌrɔːl ðə ˈpɪktʃə ɪz mɪkst/", "tho_noi": "âuvơrol-dhơ-pikchơ-iz-mikst", "tu": [{"tu": "Overall", "ipa": "ˈəʊvəˌrɔːl", "nguon": "cmu"}, {"tu": "the", "ipa": "ðə", "nguon": "cmu"}, {"tu": "picture", "ipa": "ˈpɪktʃə", "nguon": "cmu"}, {"tu": "is", "ipa": "ɪz", "nguon": "cmu"}, {"tu": "mixed", "ipa": "mɪkst", "nguon": "cmu"}]}}, {"en": "Cohesion is what makes writing flow.", "vi": "Sự liên kết là điều làm bài viết mượt.", "pa": {"cau": "Cohesion is what makes writing flow.", "ipa_day_du": "/kəʊˈhiːʒən/ /ɪz/ /wʌt/ /meɪks/ /ˈraɪtɪŋ/ /fləʊ/", "ipa_noi": "/kəʊˈhiːʒən‿ɪz‿wʌt meɪks ˈraɪtɪŋ fləʊ/", "tho_noi": "kâuhizhơn-iz-wât-mâyks-raiting-flâu", "tu": [{"tu": "Cohesion", "ipa": "kəʊˈhiːʒən", "nguon": "cmu"}, {"tu": "is", "ipa": "ɪz", "nguon": "cmu"}, {"tu": "what", "ipa": "wʌt", "nguon": "cmu"}, {"tu": "makes", "ipa": "meɪks", "nguon": "cmu"}, {"tu": "writing", "ipa": "ˈraɪtɪŋ", "nguon": "cmu"}, {"tu": "flow", "ipa": "fləʊ", "nguon": "cmu"}]}}, {"en": "Each paragraph should link to the last.", "vi": "Mỗi đoạn nên liên kết với đoạn trước.", "pa": {"cau": "Each paragraph should link to the last.", "ipa_day_du": "/iːtʃ/ /ˈpærəˌɡræf/ /ʃʊd/ /lɪŋk/ /tuː